  "2026-10-20T11:37:09.803Z","harness:codex","Live October20 continuation check: zero open GitHub dependency PRs, zero open Dependabot/code-scanning/secret-scanning alerts, and pnpm audit reports zero advisories at all severities. Registry confirms eslint10.13.0 was published October16 14:24UTC and knip6.42.1 October19 18:24UTC; both remain below seven-day cooldown, as do the previously documented October18 token/review minor updates. Existing major-migration owners are unchanged. This item remains open and unclaimed; no unsafe or premature upgrade was applied."
  "2026-10-21T04:30:46.642Z","harness:codex","October21 live registry refresh: eslint10.13.0 published2026-10-16T14:24:10Z, gpt-tokenizer4.1.0 October18T05:43:37Z, greptile3.7.0 October18T00:02:04Z, knip6.42.1 October19T18:24:59Z and typescript-eslint8.72.0 October19T17:08:09Z. All remain below the configured seven-day cooldown. The pnpm outdated census also retains the already-owned Sentry11, Vitest5/CodSpeed6, npm-package-arg14 and TypeScript7 migrations. GitHub has0 open dependency PRs and0 open dependency or security alerts. Keep this existing owner open/unclaimed; no cooldown or compatibility floor is bypassed."
